00:28:18.599 --> 00:28:19.720
Let's be rational.

00:28:20.200 --> 00:28:21.000
Okay?

00:28:24.440 --> 00:28:26.039
I've always been rational.

00:28:26.319 --> 00:28:27.720
You've been meticulously planning

00:28:27.880 --> 00:28:29.599
to kill him with cold calculation.

00:28:29.839 --> 00:28:30.759
But you're not rational

00:28:30.759 --> 00:28:31.960
about the bigger picture.

00:28:33.000 --> 00:28:34.519
Zeng Jie ruined your youthful years,

00:28:34.839 --> 00:28:36.160
but that's in the past.

00:28:36.400 --> 00:28:37.880
You still have a bright future.

00:28:38.519 --> 00:28:39.359
You're so young

00:28:39.599 --> 00:28:40.119
and pretty.

00:28:40.599 --> 00:28:41.599
And you're loved.

00:28:43.000 --> 00:28:43.759
Do you have to

00:28:43.799 --> 00:28:44.920
give up everything?

00:28:49.160 --> 00:28:50.359
Your plan is not

00:28:50.440 --> 00:28:51.720
that flawless.

00:28:53.119 --> 00:28:54.079
Think about it.

00:28:54.720 --> 00:28:55.519
Li De

00:28:55.759 --> 00:28:56.480
and I

00:28:56.720 --> 00:28:58.400
have both uncovered flaws.

00:29:02.319 --> 00:29:03.640
Amateurs can't outplay

00:29:03.640 --> 00:29:04.599
professionals.

00:29:10.440 --> 00:29:11.200
I know

00:29:12.039 --> 00:29:13.000
your father is waiting

00:29:13.079 --> 00:29:14.400
somewhere right now.

00:29:15.680 --> 00:29:16.599
Do you want to

00:29:16.640 --> 00:29:17.960
drag him into this?

00:29:19.680 --> 00:29:20.640
To punish Zeng Jie,

00:29:21.640 --> 00:29:22.319
do you

00:29:22.880 --> 00:29:23.759
and your father

00:29:24.559 --> 00:29:25.880
have to sacrifice everything?

00:29:27.480 --> 00:29:28.240
Is it worth it?

00:29:47.720 --> 00:29:48.480
Trust me.

00:29:50.119 --> 00:29:51.519
This is for the best.

